{"height": 7, "weight": 350, "base_experience": 50, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-attack", "value": 1}], "genus": "Lava Pokémon", "capture_rate": 190, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["indeterminate"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "マグマッグ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Magmag"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "마그마그"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "熔岩蟲"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Limagma"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Schneckmag"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Slugma"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Slugma"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "マグマッグ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "熔岩虫"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Slugma"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["pearl", "platinum", "diamond", "black", "white", "black-2", "white-2", "y"], "text": "Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."}, {"versions": ["gold", "leafgreen", "heartgold"], "text": "It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden."}, {"versions": ["silver"], "text": "A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a con­ stant search for warm places."}, {"versions": ["crystal"], "text": "These group to­ gether in areas that are hotter than normal. If it cools off, its skin hardens."}, {"versions": ["ruby"], "text": "Molten magma courses throughout SLUGMA’s circulatory system. If this POKéMON is chilled, the magma cools and hardens. Its body turns brittle and chunks fall off, reducing its size."}, {"versions": ["sapphire"], "text": "SLUGMA does not have any blood in its body. Instead, intensely hot magma circulates throughout this POKéMON’s body, carrying essential nutrients and oxygen to its organs."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "It is a species of POKéMON that lives in volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that, it sleeps near magma."}, {"versions": ["firered", "